    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are proud to present 8 Nutley Lane, a beautifully renovated and extended family home in a most sought after, prime Dublin 4 location to the open market. \nThis exceptional (B energy rated) four bedroom (plus two attic rooms) family residence has been thoughtfully renovated and significantly extended to create a superb contemporary home of outstanding quality and style. Presented in true turn-key condition, the property offers generously proportioned accommodation that flows effortlessly throughout, perfectly designed for\nmodern family living. \nUpon entering, a welcoming entrance hall sets the tone for the quality and finish found throughout the home. To the front, a comfortable living room provides an elegant space for relaxation, while the heart of the home is undoubtedly the impressive open-plan kitchen, dining and family room. Flooded with natural light, this stunning space is ideal for everyday living and entertaining alike, with seamless access to the beautifully landscaped rear garden. A versatile TV room/home office offers additional living accommodation, complemented by a practical utility room and guest WC.\n\nAt first-floor level, there are four generous bedrooms, two of which benefit from luxurious\nensuite bathrooms. A well-appointed family bathroom serves the remaining bedrooms. The\naccommodation is further enhanced by two substantial attic rooms and an additional\nbathroom, providing excellent flexibility for a variety of family needs including home\nworking, guest accommodation, hobbies or recreational use. \nOutside, the rear garden has been thoughtfully landscaped to create a private, low- maintenance outdoor sanctuary. A generous sandstone-paved patio provides the perfect setting for al fresco dining and entertaining, while steps lead to an artificial lawn bordered by mature hedging and established planting, creating a peaceful and secluded environment. To the front, a private driveway provides valuable off-street parking.\n\nThe location is second to none, enjoying close proximity to Donnybrook and Ballsbridge with\ntheir excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, boutiques and everyday amenities. The property\nis within easy reach of a host of highly regarded junior and senior schools, St. Vincent's\nUniversity Hospital, The Merrion Centre and University College Dublin. Excellent transport\nlinks, including the Quality Bus Corridor (QBC), provide swift access to the city centre and\nbeyond. Numerous recreational facilities, parks and sports clubs are also nearby, making this\nan ideal setting for family life.\n\nA truly outstanding family home where quality, comfort and convenience combine to create\nan exceptional living environment. \n\nEarly viewing of this fine family home comes highly\nrecommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hallway - \nThe welcoming entrance hallway features attractive tiled flooring and provides access to the main living accommodation of the home.\n\nLiving Room - \nThe bright and spacious living room is finished with solid wood flooring and benefits from a large front-facing window that floods the room with natural light. A feature open fireplace with a tiled insert and surround, complemented by an elegant marble mantelpiece, creates a warm and inviting atmosphere.\n\nRoom / Home Office - \nLocated to the front of the property, this versatile room is currently suited for use as a TV room or home office. The room is finished with carpet flooring and enjoys pleasant views over the front garden through a large window.\n\nGuest WC - \nThe guest WC is finished with fully tiled walls and flooring and comprises a WC and wash hand basin with a fitted storage cabinet underneath. Additional fitted cabinetry provides excellent storage solutions.\n\nUtility Room - \nThe utility room features tiled flooring and is fitted with shelving and cabinetry, providing ample storage space. It is plumbed for a washing machine and houses the gas boiler. A door from the utility room provides convenient access to the side entrance and rear garden.\n\nKitchen / Living / Dining Room - \nThe impressive open-plan kitchen, living and dining area forms the heart of the home and is ideally designed for modern family living. The space features tiled flooring throughout and a beautiful fireplace with a gas insert, tiled surround and marble mantelpiece. The kitchen is fitted with high-quality Tierney's cabinetry, quartz worktops, quartz upstands andsplashbacks, and a range of integrated appliances including a NEFF oven, electric hob with overhead extractor fan, Bosch dishwasher, and fridge/freezer. A large central island provides additional seating, storage and workspace. Floor-to-ceiling sliding patio doors, together with dual-aspect glazing, flood the room with natural light and offer attractive views over the\n\nBedroom 1 - \nBedroom 1 is a spacious double bedroom located to the front of the property. The room benefits from a large window, extensive fitted wardrobes providing excellent storage, and soft carpet flooring for added comfort.\n\nBedroom 2 - \nBedroom 2 is a generously proportioned double bedroom with two front-facing windows allowing for an abundance of natural light. The room features fitted wardrobes, carpet flooring and direct access to a private en-suite bathroom.\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - \nThe ensuite bathroom is finished with fully tiled walls and flooring and comprises a WC, wash hand basin with fitted storage cabinet and a walk-in shower cubicle.\n\nBedroom 3 - \nBedroom 3 is a large double bedroom overlooking the rear garden. The room is finished with carpet flooring, benefits from fitted wardrobes and enjoys direct access to its own ensuite bathroom.\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - \nThe ensuite bathroom is fully tiled and includes a WC, wash hand basin and walk-in showercubicle, offering both comfort and convenience.\n\nBedroom 4 - \nBedroom 4 is a comfortable single bedroom overlooking the rear garden. Finished with carpetflooring, the room is ideal for use as a child's bedroom, guest room or home office.\n\nFamily Bathroom - \nThe family bathroom is beautifully presented with fully tiled walls and flooring. It comprisesa bath with overhead shower, WC and wash hand basin with fitted storage cabinet. Additionalfeatures include a heated towel rail and a frosted window overlooking the rear of the property.\n\nLanding - \nThe attic landing is bright and spacious, featuring carpet flooring, Velux windows, recessedlighting and useful eaves storage.\n\nAttic Room 1 - \nAttic Room 1 is a spacious and versatile room featuring four large Velux windows that floodthe space with natural light. The room benefits from carpet flooring, recessed lightingthroughout and extensive eaves storage. A door leads directly to a private ensuite bathroom.\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - \nThe ensuite bathroom is fitted with laminate flooring and includes a WC, wash hand basinwith storage unit underneath, heated towel rail and a Velux window. Recessed lightingcompletes the modern finish.\n\nAttic Room 2 - \nAttic Room 2 is another versatile space that could be used as a home office, gym, hobbyroom or additional accommodation. The room features carpet flooring, a Velux window,recessed lighting and useful eaves storage.\n\n"
      },
      {
